      "message": "\u003e This should probably be extracted to a (non-static) method on VirtualMachine.\n\n\nWouldn\u0027t that require an additional api \u0026 be in scope of api changes then?\n\nAlso, currently the claiming of VM instance is hidden in a way. Instance-id (or instance.img) are under the hood implementation details.\n\nSo if we extract out this into `VirtualMachine::claimInstance()`, it increases 1 step in claiming the VM. What if the user does `fromDescriptor` but not claimInstance().  It is seems the only sensible place to call `VirtualMachine::claimInstance` is after constructing VM from a descriptor \u0026 the current code achieves it?",
